WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:07.440
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a Japanese science-fiction thriller film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:15.920
called “AI Amok.” Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:24.240
Kosuke Kiryu is a brilliant scientist from Japan&nbsp;
who has developed an advanced AI called Hope for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:29.840
medical purposes. His main motive for all the&nbsp;
hard work he has put into the AI is his wife’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:35.120
cancer treatment. If the technology is approved by&nbsp;
the government to be used in the medical sector,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:40.720
it will not only save his wife’s life but will&nbsp;
be a revolutionary step in human development.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.200
At the beginning of the movie, Kiryu is in&nbsp;
his lab working when his brother-in-law,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:51.200
Satoru Nishimura comes to him with some paperwork.&nbsp;
It turns out that the government has refused to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.040
endorse the use of AI because of the absence of&nbsp;
relevant jurisdiction. In the following scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:03.600
Kiryu, his wife, and Satoru are on a beach with&nbsp;
Kiryu’s daughter Kokoro. His wife is in the last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:09.840
stage of cancer and needs immediate help from&nbsp;
the AI. Although Kiryu invented the AI, he and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:15.600
his wife refuse to use it illegally without proper&nbsp;
authorization. The family takes a picture together&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:21.840
at the beach. A few days later, Kiryu’s wife is&nbsp;
on her deathbed, she passes away after saying that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:27.760
she hopes the AI will one day bring joy to many&nbsp;
people’s lives. If it had been approved in time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:33.600
Kiryu could have saved his wife. A year after her&nbsp;
death, the medical AI system is approved by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:39.120
government and distributed among the people. 
Not long after, it starts being used in every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:45.840
sector like law, finance, entertainment, and most&nbsp;
importantly medical. Because of the technology,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:51.360
cures for several diseases are found. In only&nbsp;
a few years, Kiryu's achievement is belatedly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:58.080
celebrated worldwide. His brother-in-law Satoru&nbsp;
becomes the president of Hope managing it overall.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:03.600
After fulfilling his wife’s dying wish, Kiryu&nbsp;
doesn’t want to live in Japan anymore. So, he and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:09.280
his daughter move to Singapore. The popularity of&nbsp;
Hope rises exponentially when a personalized watch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:14.240
that takes care of one’s health is introduced.&nbsp;
Now, people do not have to go to the doctor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:23.360
to be diagnosed with problems like brain tumors&nbsp;
and cancer. Although most of the world celebrates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:28.160
the new invention, there are some who believe&nbsp;
that it will cause the problem of unemployment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:33.840
to rise exponentially. Many people protest&nbsp;
against Hope but it has become indispensable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:39.680
to the lives of most Japanese citizens. 
In 2030, Kiryu and Kokoro are living in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:46.080
beach house in Singapore. However, Kokoro misses&nbsp;
her mother a lot and desires to return to Japan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:51.040
One day, they get a message from Satoru saying&nbsp;
that the president of Japan wants to award Kiryu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.920
for his achievements. Taking the opportunity,&nbsp;
the father and daughter fly back to Japan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.920 --> 00:03:01.200
and are surprised to see several protesters&nbsp;
outside the Hope headquarters. They are welcomed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:06.800
by Satoru and the entire company with a round of&nbsp;
applause. Following that, they are given a tour&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:12.240
of the building. They get to see the server room&nbsp;
where the “heart” of hope is kept. It is a massive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:17.440
machine that serves as the core motherboard of&nbsp;
Hope. The place is highly secured because the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:23.120
machine is connected to the lives of every Hope&nbsp;
user. Two drones from the “heart” recognize Kokoro&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:28.560
using their face scanning feature. Following the&nbsp;
tour, a press conference is held to welcome Kiryu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:33.840
and for him to talk about his invention. During&nbsp;
the conference, the protesters manage to break in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:38.960
and interrupt Kiryu while he is talking. 
Following that, Kiryu meets a police officer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:45.040
named Sakuraba. Sakuraba has been bothering Satoru&nbsp;
to let the police department use Hope to hack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:50.240
people’s personal belongings and solve crimes.&nbsp;
Since it would be a breach of people’s privacy he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:59.760
has been denied the request. On his way out, Kiryu&nbsp;
is followed by a journalist who is clearly against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:06.000
AI. He hands Kiryu his card claiming that he wants&nbsp;
to interview him. When Kiryu and Kokoro are in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.200
car, the little girl notices that she has lost&nbsp;
the only picture of her mother. She runs inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:16.000
with the staff to look for it while Kiryu and a&nbsp;
girl drive to the convention where he is being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:21.520
awarded by the president. Kokoro and the others go&nbsp;
to the server room to look for the lost picture.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:27.280
Meanwhile, in several different hospitals in&nbsp;
Japan, Hope suddenly starts to malfunction. Many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:32.560
patients die because of the lag while the medical&nbsp;
workers panic, not knowing what is causing it. 
&nbsp;

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:36.960
Somewhere else, the president is preparing&nbsp;
for the program but she suddenly drops to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:43.120
the ground. It turns out that her heart pacer also&nbsp;
ran on Hope which stopped working. She is rushed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:48.720
to the hospital but to no avail. The automated&nbsp;
driving system that uses Hope also malfunctions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:54.240
causing several accidents. As Hope stops working&nbsp;
throughout the nation, Satoru and the engineers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:58.880
in the headquarters are informed. They run to the&nbsp;
control room to find out what is wrong with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:03.760
program, leaving Kokoro alone in the server&nbsp;
room. Because of the breach in the system,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:09.360
the security lock is activated and Kokoro is&nbsp;
locked alone. The news makes it to the TV and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:14.960
Kiryu also finds out about the malfunctions. When&nbsp;
he calls his brother, he is even more worried to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:20.720
see Kokoro locked alone in the server room. With&nbsp;
time, the room’s temperature will drop below zero&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:26.080
for the machines to cool. They will have to bring&nbsp;
her out before she dies of cold. The programmers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:30.800
at Hope get to work and find out that there has&nbsp;
been a strange log-in to the protected server&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:35.200
which supposedly caused the malfunctions.
They locate the area where the hacker is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:40.720
and send little insect-like filming devices&nbsp;
to the location. Meanwhile, a worried Kiryu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:46.480
is stuck in traffic. He opens his bag and finds&nbsp;
a tablet that is uploading the virus to Hope.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:52.000
Just then, the police locate him and arrest him&nbsp;
for being the hacker. It is clear that someone is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:58.160
trying to frame him but Kiryu has no way to prove&nbsp;
it. Just then, a car accident takes place nearby&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:03.600
that distracts the police and he manages to&nbsp;
escape. Throughout all this, the journalist&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:09.280
from earlier is taking his pictures from a car&nbsp;
behind him. With the suspect escaping, Sakuraba&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:14.480
and his team are given the responsibility to catch&nbsp;
him. Taking the opportunity, Sakuraba uses the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:24.240
Hope AI program to look for Kiryu, without waiting&nbsp;
for permission. Two officers named Godo and Asano&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:29.520
are also added to the team to help them. Godo&nbsp;
doesn’t feel comfortable seeing Sakuraba invading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:35.360
the public's privacy to look for Kiryu. Using&nbsp;
CCTV cameras, cameras from people’s dashboards,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:41.200
and even cameras from people's mobile phones,&nbsp;
Sakuraba is able to locate Kiryu. At one point&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:47.120
Kiryu realizes that he is being watched, so he&nbsp;
enters the sewers. He calls Satoshi from there and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:52.400
tells him that someone is trying to frame him.
The call is being traced so Sakuraba and the team&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:57.840
can hear them talking. Kiryu reveals that when he&nbsp;
first created Hope, he made sure to program that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:02.960
it worked for human comfort and satisfaction.&nbsp;
He believes that in recent years someone has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.840
programmed Hope differently, that is why it has&nbsp;
started to work on its own and not take human’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:13.920
command. The AI will soon evaluate citizens and&nbsp;
terminate those it deems worthless. This puts the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:19.760
whole nation at risk of being killed by it. Just&nbsp;
then, we see an infant in a stroller that is run&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:24.400
by the AI. It calculates the overall medical&nbsp;
bill that the infant might have to pay in its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:33.440
entire life and deems it to be unworthy of life.&nbsp;
Following that, the stroller falls off the stairs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:44.960
eliminating the baby itself. To stop the mass&nbsp;
murder, a new program must be input to the server.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:50.240
After the call ends, the soldiers enter the&nbsp;
tunnel and find Kiryu. He breaks his tablet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:55.760
so he won’t be tracked. Sakuraba loses all&nbsp;
stats about his location after that and Kiryu,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.760 --> 00:08:02.240
yet again, manages to escape. Goda and Asano get&nbsp;
out of Sakuraba’s control room. After hearing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:08.080
Kiryu talk to Satoshi, Goda believes that he is&nbsp;
innocent. The two think from Kiryu’s perspective&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:13.120
and come to a conclusion that he will probably&nbsp;
go to Hope’s second data center in Sendai.
&nbsp;

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:18.560
Back in the headquarters everyone tries to&nbsp;
get Kokoro out of the server room but is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:25.120
unsuccessful. She lies in front of the heart, cold&nbsp;
and scared. To reach the data center in Sendai,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:32.000
Kiryu boards a ferry hiding inside a truck. Goda&nbsp;
and Asano also get on the same ferry. Kiryu had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:37.200
stolen a tablet from a person which he uses to&nbsp;
program. The police track the signals and find&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:42.240
out his location. The officials at the ferry are&nbsp;
informed and told to check everywhere for him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:46.800
When they eventually find him, he makes a run&nbsp;
for it and ends up on the top of the deck.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:52.880
Goda and Asano tell him they are there to help&nbsp;
but before he can reply a sniper from a helicopter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:59.040
fires at him. To save his life, Kiryu jumps&nbsp;
into the water and disappears. A while later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:05.200
he opens his eyes and finds himself on a boat in a&nbsp;
harbor at Sengai. A local fisherman had saved him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:10.080
from drowning. He says that he is thankful for&nbsp;
Hope because it saved his wife’s life and lets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:16.480
Kiryu go. Meanwhile, many protests against Hope&nbsp;
are being held throughout the country. Kiryu has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:21.120
been declared a terrorist by the media. 
In Sendai, Kiryu goes to an abandoned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:26.400
university that was the place where he first&nbsp;
invented Hope. He is soon joined by Satoshi.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:30.320
It turns out that when they talked on the&nbsp;
phone the last time, he used a code word&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:35.600
to call him there. Goda also debunks the code word&nbsp;
and drives to the university with his partner.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:41.360
Kiryu and Satoshi start writing a program to stop&nbsp;
the destruction being caused by Hope. The computer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:47.760
scans every citizen of Japan who uses AI and plans&nbsp;
to terminate them according to their past. It&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:53.600
will take exactly six hours for the mass murder to&nbsp;
start. The engineers at the Hope headquarters also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:59.360
find this out and start calling their families&nbsp;
to ask them to stay away from their AI devices.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:04.480
Kiryu then figures out that no one had hacked&nbsp;
the program and the virus was manually planted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:09.440
in the heart. On checking the heart’s data&nbsp;
for the past few months they find suspicious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:16.160
activity. But on checking the CCTV footage, Kiryu&nbsp;
is shocked. It turns out that Satoshi was the one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:21.920
who uploaded the virus. However, Satoshi denies&nbsp;
the claims saying that he was just doing a regular&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:26.720
check and doesn’t know what went wrong.
Just then, the soldiers arrive at the hideout&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:33.440
and fire at Kiryu. To save him, Satoshi jumps in&nbsp;
front and gets shot instead. With his last breath,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:38.960
he begs his brother-in-law to save the people.&nbsp;
Kiryu manages to escape yet again while being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:45.040
followed by the police. Goda and Asano also&nbsp;
follow them behind in their car. Amidst the chase,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:50.640
Kiryu’s car falls off the road and crashes several&nbsp;
feet below. The police check for him in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:58.000
wreckage but do not find his body. Police officer&nbsp;
Sakuraba uses AI and the CCTVs to look for Kiryu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:02.960
and finds him but when the police reach the&nbsp;
location, the person turns out to be someone else.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:08.160
It is then revealed that Kiryu has bugged the&nbsp;
police’s AI system, making it malfunction.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:12.640
While they try to look for him, Kiryu manages&nbsp;
to return to the Hope headquarters and meets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:17.120
the chief engineer who is willing to help him&nbsp;
stop the massacre that is about to happen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:22.240
However, Sakuraba and his team somehow make&nbsp;
it to the headquarters and surround him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:26.480
Kiryu tells the soldiers that the&nbsp;
real culprit is actually Sakuraba.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:31.440
Then, he plays a video of Satoshi inputting the&nbsp;
virus to the heart. It turns out that he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:36.480
actually tricked by Sakuraba who was standing&nbsp;
outside the server room when it happened. 
&nbsp;

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:41.520
Even though it is proved that Sakuraba caused&nbsp;
Hope to malfunction, the soldiers still follow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:47.680
his orders. Sakuraba then says that Japan needs a&nbsp;
powerful system to rule the world. With something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:53.840
like AI, he could have all the power in the&nbsp;
world. As he confesses to all his crimes, a flying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.840 --> 00:12:03.840
insect-like device records their conversation&nbsp;
and broadcasts it live to the entire world. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:09.920
everyone knows the truth. Goda arrests Sakuraba&nbsp;
and takes him away while Kiryu runs to repair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:15.360
Hope and save his daughter. He programs the code&nbsp;
and makes the heart scan it with Kokoro’s help.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:21.040
Hope finally remembers its past and the reason for&nbsp;
its creation. The door to the server room opens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:29.280
and the father and daughter reunite. 
